+RED-1 (a.qs.x ^= 0x88888888 in the Q4_K/Q5_K mmvq_load_a): hoist ON 4/8 passed, red at n=1..4; hoist OFF 4/8 passed, red at n=1..4 -> the decode site executes on both arms at every MMVQ width (q4_K n<=4 on AMD); n=5..8 green = f32 route, as ggml_vk_should_use_mmvq says.
+RED-2 (+1.0 in the hoisted nest): hoist ON 5/8 passed, red at n=2..4, n=1 green (the fold takes the OFF path at n=1 by design); hoist OFF 8/8 passed -> only the hoisted nest serves the ON arm at n>=2.
+Earlier receipts 20-36 are VOID (ran on pre-change shaders after an HQ checkout discarded the draft). Restore build rc=0, tree clean (git status 0 modified).
